(6353058, 939317, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, I like that you chose B&amp;W. I gave it a 9. The light on his cap and beard provide great texture, and the cap, beard, and the rings on his hand provide a nice triangle of interest that holds my eye. Congratulations on your first ribbon and a PB!</td>', 'Lovely shot, I like that you chose B&W. I gave it a 9. The light on his cap and beard provide great texture, and the cap, beard, and the rings on his hand provide a nice triangle of interest that holds my eye. Congratulations on your first ribbon and a PB!', '2011-03-16 10:20:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353074, 939807, 35545, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and composition.  I love that form in the lower left - a wolf pouncing?<br/> <br/>Brown is beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful color and composition.  I love that form in the lower left - a wolf pouncing? Brown is beautiful.', '2011-03-16 10:40:25.000000', NULL, 0),
