(6353114, 939796, 65319, '<td valign="top">At last, I''m out of the doghouse and my cave troll days are OVER!  9 from me!  When The Matrix meets Harry Potter and draws the card of the Wheel of Fortune...nothing can stop you now!  Well done, Jason!  <br/> <br/>Uh Oh...did Puppy Bear beat you?!  Bad Puppy Bear!</td>', 'At last, I''m out of the doghouse and my cave troll days are OVER!  9 from me!  When The Matrix meets Harry Potter and draws the card of the Wheel of Fortune...nothing can stop you now!  Well done, Jason!   Uh Oh...did Puppy Bear beat you?!  Bad Puppy Bear!', '2011-03-16 11:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353117, 939041, 65319, '<td valign="top">Well, this one had "Puppy Bear" written all over it!  The sun at it''s joyful best!  Did you steal Jason''s 1,000,000th green ribbon?!!!</td>', 'Well, this one had "Puppy Bear" written all over it!  The sun at it''s joyful best!  Did you steal Jason''s 1,000,000th green ribbon?!!!', '2011-03-16 11:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
