(6353204, 939431, 53814, '<td valign="top">This has a photographic innocence to it that I find very refreshing. Wonderful colors, the off-white balance works to your advantage in the overall color scheme - it is an effect I often try to duplicate in post processing.</td>', 'This has a photographic innocence to it that I find very refreshing. Wonderful colors, the off-white balance works to your advantage in the overall color scheme - it is an effect I often try to duplicate in post processing.', '2011-03-16 12:25:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353213, 939205, 68947, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe that this didn''t do better!  I was shocked to see it one above mine because I thought for sure this would be a front pager!  I had to come take a look at where this landed in scores and when I didn''t find it in the top 10...I was really shocked.  But, why should I be shocked.  DPC has a life of its own.</td>', 'I cannot believe that this didn''t do better!  I was shocked to see it one above mine because I thought for sure this would be a front pager!  I had to come take a look at where this landed in scores and when I didn''t find it in the top 10...I was really shocked.  But, why should I be shocked.  DPC has a life of its own.', '2011-03-16 12:28:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353283, 939748, 44877, '<td valign="top">Yay - glad to see you got The Red Hand of Appreciation. This is a brilliant image. Very compelling, arty, and fascinating - for me, at least. Being a seasoned Tarot reader, I''m all over this for Temperance.</td>', 'Yay - glad to see you got The Red Hand of Appreciation. This is a brilliant image. Very compelling, arty, and fascinating - for me, at least. Being a seasoned Tarot reader, I''m all over this for Temperance.', '2011-03-16 12:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353286, 939653, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m happy to hear "tilt" = "rotate" :-) Congrats on your first ribbon! Cool shot, in more ways than one. As an aside, even if it WERE advanced editing I wouldn''t have risked removing the cannon plug :-)</td>', 'I''m happy to hear "tilt" = "rotate" :-) Congrats on your first ribbon! Cool shot, in more ways than one. As an aside, even if it WERE advanced editing I wouldn''t have risked removing the cannon plug :-)', '2011-03-16 12:46:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6353289, 939690, 44877, '<td valign="top">I like this for the Empress. May be a shoehorn, but it works. I think it should have scored higher.</td>', 'I like this for the Empress. May be a shoehorn, but it works. I think it should have scored higher.', '2011-03-16 12:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
